# No AI attribution

- Never add Co-authored-by Cursor, Made with Cursor, or any AI/tool logo/badge
- Never put Cursor/AI as contributor, author, or commit trailer
- Commits and PRs must look like a normal human developer authored them
- Do not add Cursor branding to README, LICENSE, or repo metadata